  "prefLabel": "We 104.02 Previously Existing Wells",
  "priorExpiration": "1996-08-13",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "We 104.02 Previously Existing Wells. Pursuant to Chapter 359:2, Laws of 1983, wells constructed prior to August 17, 1983 shall not be required to conform to the provisions of the rules except that any well hereafter abandoned shall comply with the provisions of We 604.\n\nSource. #2557, eff 12-27-83; ss by #4730, eff 1-15-90; ss by #4898, eff 8-13-90; EXPIRED: 8-13-96\n\nNew. #6448, eff 1-29-97; ss by #7306, eff 6-13-00; ss by #9177, eff 6-13-08",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/we100-1000.html"
